===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}
[[Image:Clinching getting the back.jpg|thumb|right|(Sense 6) One [[wrestling|wrestler]] is trying to get the back.]]

# Any of several [[fastening]]s.
# The act or process of holding fast; that which serves to hold fast; a [[grip]] or [[grasp]].
#: ''to get a good '''clinch''' of an antagonist, or of a weapon''
#: ''to secure anything by a '''clinch'''''
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} A [[pun]].
#: {{rfquotek|lang=en|Alexander Pope}}
# {{lb|en|nautical}} A [[hitch]] or [[bend]] by which a rope is made fast to the ring of an [[anchor]], or the [[breeching]] of a ship's gun to the [[ringbolt]]s.
# A passionate [[embrace]].
# In combat sports, the act of one or both fighters holding onto the other to prevent being hit or engage in standup [[grapple|grappling]].

